type: txt
help: Base reachable time in seconds (default: 30)
val_help: u32:1-86400; Base reachable time in seconds
syntax:expression: exec "${vyos_libexec_dir}/validate-value  --exec \"${vyos_validators_dir}/numeric --range 1-86400\"  --value \'$VAR(@)\'"; "Base reachable time must be between 1 and 86400 seconds"
